msgid "@niko The fireflies light up this room."
msgstr "@niko Les lucioles éclairent cette pièce."

msgid "@niko Looks like moss..."
msgstr "@niko On dirait de la mousse..."

msgid "@niko_speak I guess people eat those!"
msgstr "@niko_speak J'imagine que les gens en mangent !"

msgid "If nothing else, I'm sure everyone would like to see the sun again!"
msgstr "En tous cas, je parie que tout le monde aimerait revoir le soleil !"

msgid "@alula_speak Yeah!"
msgstr "@alula_speak Oui !"

msgid "It's slowly being chipped away already.\\nBut it's still trying to stay alive, I think."
msgstr "Il se dégrade lentement, petit à petit.\\nMais je crois qu'il essaie de rester en vie."

msgid "Doesn't matter... one day the world will finally give up this fight."
msgstr "Peu importe... Un jour, le monde finira par abandonner."

msgid "I just hope I'm not alive to see it."
msgstr "J'espère simplement que je ne serai plus là pour le voir."

msgid "@alula But the savior is here!"
msgstr "@alula Mais le messie est là !"

msgid "That won't fix the root of the problem."
msgstr "Ça ne résoudra pas le fond du problème."

msgid "@niko Just like the other lady said..."
msgstr "@niko Comme l'a dit la dame tout à l'heure..."

msgid "@alula_oh Other... lady?"
msgstr "@alula_oh La... dame ?"

msgid "@niko_speak Yeah! She's this robot and she seemed kinda sad..."
msgstr "@niko_speak Oui ! C'était un robot, et elle avait l'air plutôt triste..."

msgid "@alula_pout Ah..."
msgstr "@alula_pout Ah..."

msgid "Oh! But don't lose heart!\\nWithout the sun, the world will die much faster."
msgstr "Oh ! Mais ne te laisse pas abattre !\\nSans soleil, le monde mourra beaucoup plus rapidement."

msgid "At the very least...\\nI'm sure everyone would like to see the sun again."
msgstr "Au moins...\\nJe sais que tout le monde aimerait revoir le soleil."

msgid "Right, little one?"
msgstr "N'est-ce pas, petite ?"

msgid "@alula_speak Yup!"
msgstr "@alula_speak Ouaip !"

msgid "@niko_speak I'm bringing back the sun, though..."
msgstr "@niko_speak Mais je ramène le soleil..."

msgid "But don't lose heart!\\nWithout the sun, the world will die much faster."
msgstr "Mais ne te laisse pas abattre !\\nSans soleil, le monde mourra beaucoup plus rapidement."

